  "clauses": [
    "The backend is Running on the idle capture. The fake switches to a Stopped status of another tailnet and self with no peers, holds the next /prefs and pushes a notification; once the fake holds that /prefs it releases it with all four switches flipped. Then every property the new snapshot changes reads its new value: state Stopped, tailnet, selfName, selfIp4, selfIp6, selfDnsName, wantRunning, acceptRoutes, acceptDns and exitNodeAllowLANAccess, and both models empty"
  ],
  "deferred": [
